:: Premium Pill Slave
<<effects>>
You aren't paying attention to anything except the rhythm of your own steady footsteps, almost too steady for someone who has swallowed an experimental pill from Briar. 
Maybe the things Briar says are actually all right, and you can get a free pill with a free choice. Such a win!
<br><br> 
The thought makes you smile faintly. You really are getting used to these things. 
<br><br> 
You turn the corner and suddenly a hand clamps over your mouth before you hear so much as a boot scuff. 
